12:["$","section",null,{"id":"how","className":"ix-how","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How it works"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"ix-how-sub","children":"Three moving parts. Each one is a contract you can read, and every hop between them is a public onchain event."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"ix-how-grid","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"ix-how-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"ix-how-n","children":"01"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Volume becomes fuel"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Every ETH ↔ $PENNY swap on Robinhood Chain pays a ","3","% WETH fee into the treasury. The fee is enforced by an immutable Uniswap v4 hook — both directions, capped in code, no override."]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"ix-how-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"ix-how-n","children":"02"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Fuel becomes stocks"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"The treasury spends itself on the five Stock Tokens in equal parts — Chainlink-priced, market-session-guarded, all-or-nothing. Every purchase is a public onchain event."}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"ix-how-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"ix-how-n","children":"03"}],["$","h3",null,{"children":"Stocks become yours"}],["$","p",null,{"children":["Hold ","100,000","+ $PENNY at the snapshot, pass the one-time eligibility check, sign once to opt in — then rewards just show up, every epoch. No claiming. No gas. Opt out anytime."]}]]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"ix-life","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"ix-kicker","children":"ONE EPOCH, START TO FINISH"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"ix-life-rows","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"ix-life-row","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"ix-life-n","children":"1"}],["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Someone trades."}]," A swap in the ETH/$PENNY pool fires the fee hook: ","3","% of the WETH leg goes straight to the FeeCollector. Nothing is skimmed — the fee address